### ⚠️ Critical Notes & Caveats

1.  **Greedy Purity Warning (Block 10 & 13):**
    *   **Block 10:** Changes decode numerics on K-split paths1.46.745.346 I slot print_timing: id  0 | task 0 | n_gen =   1479, tg =  24.88 t/s, tg_3s =  28.59 t/s
